      },
      {
       "text": "Also, the console versions of Verho - Curse of Faces are now available! You can now venture into the land of Yariv and take on the dreaded Curse of Faces on any platform you please (including the latest game modes!)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
