  {
   "id": "verho-curse-of-faces-318767@major-2026-01-31",
   "gameId": "verho-curse-of-faces-318767",
   "displayName": "New Game Plus Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-01-31T14:04:18.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Greetings, travellers!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Thank you for playing Verho: Curse of Faces and for leaving such positive reviews on Steam!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We're thrilled that you enjoyed your dark journey through Yariv, and to show our appreciation, we're releasing a major free update: New Game Plus!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Once you start your second journey, you will encounter new weapons, spells, enemies and enemy placements, as well as mini-bosses!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have also re-released an improved demo so that new players can try out the first few hours of the game before buying it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To get you in the mood, here is a short teaser for the update:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Detailed overview",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Main Changes-------------------------------------------------------",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Game Plus",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New NG+ Weapon variants",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New NG+ Spell variants",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New NG+ Enemies and Mini bosses",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New NG+ Enemy and trap placements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "There is also a \"special\" thing for those madlads who will reach ng+5, have fun",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2 New overpowered rings that players can get for beating the game in under 5 hours, and beating the game without dying (one ring per challenge)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Achievements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Language Japanese(日本語)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improvements-----------------------------------------------------",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Collector rework: Health 12000 -> 10000 + Improved AI",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New anti-corruption system that should detect if your save file was corrupted due to things like real-life power outages or computer crashes while playing a game. This system should fix that automatically if it wasnt damage beyond any repair.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted music volume in Nameless Village",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Balance-----------------------------------------------------------",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Spell \"Identify\": reach x2, cast time 0.4sek -> 0.2sek, mana req 12 -> 8",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cast time of all weapon buffing spells changed from 3 sec to 0.3 sec",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Spell \"Light\": cast time 1 sec -> 0.3sec",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Glitches-----------------------------------------------------------",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"Eclipse\" defaulting to the \"dark element\" damage type with \"light\" visual when switching sets - fixed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resistance always respecing to 1 when respecting - fixed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Certain NPC dead body spawing partially underground - fixed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Error in \"small revstone\" description in Polish translation - fixed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "When destroying iron maided corpses a wrong health bar appeared - fixed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Wrong display of \"Wodden Sword\" name in upgrade and storage menu - fixed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
