       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Big changes to Last Area, new shortcuts, new paths, better balance",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Parts of Maps in Areas Swamps , Mt Ingel, Heretical Path",
