       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Option to Delete Character",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Manual",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Midnight Sickle was reworked to be more \"special\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Eye of Secret will now work even without using block (but for shorter distances) and it will also reveal invisible objects",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New secret weapon added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "All notes in Workshop are now voice-acted",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Damage of the last attack will now show next to the enemy health bar",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Grave in Nameless Village that shows you how many times you died (count starts from this patch)",
