      },
      {
       "text": "Better UI text scaling for all languages",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now Perantius's \"Talk\" option will disappear after giving him all runesteel ingots to avoid confusion",
