       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "More visibility to the last Mask Altar (too many people were missing it)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Visual update to one of the important corpses in game",
